WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.504
Follow Start Here in order: Follow Start Here in order. Open Module 1 online before installing tools, pick one course, and use Mark done so your path updates.

2
00:00:09.854 --> 00:00:19.886
Lessons, quizzes, and progress: Read each lesson, then take the module quiz. Continue banners bring you back where you left off, and certificates unlock when every module is complete.

3
00:00:20.236 --> 00:00:29.716
Guest mode vs free account: Guest progress stays in this browser. A free account can sync when the cloud is up. Keep guest progress as a backup on free hosting.

4
00:00:30.066 --> 00:00:40.770
Practice habits that stick: Type the examples instead of only reading them. Break big tasks into tiny checkpoints. When stuck, re-read the tip boxes, then open Help.

5
00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:53.072
You are ready: You are ready. Go Start Here, choose a course, and open Module 1. Watch the Python or C sharp install video when you code locally. Enjoy learning.
